        "slot": "P",
        "id": "QiyanaPassive",
        "name": "Royal Privilege",
        "maxRank": 0,
        "summary": "Qiyana's first basic attack or ability against each enemy deals bonus damage.",
        "bodyHtml": "Qiyana's Attacks and Abilities deal an additional <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">((15 ~ 67) + (25% bonus Attack Damage) + (30% Ability Power)) bonus physical damage</span>. This effect has a 25 second per-target Cooldown.<br /><br />Using <span>?</span> to gain a different weapon <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Enchantment</span> resets this effect's Cooldown on all targets.",
